            "reviewer_id": "User_12731535_1_0",
            "review_title": "Review at Rosaliza Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Fiona B\n4 contributions\n0\nDid not meet our expectations\nAug 2019 • Friends\nBased on the amazing reviews on TripAdvisor, we were looking froward to a few drinks and a tasty meal. Unfortunately this did not happen. Firstly, there was no white wine on the limited list containing 5 wines, in fact apparently 3 of the 5 advertised were not even wine, so I opted for a screwdriver, it took over 15 minutes to arrive, we were the only people in the bar. We moved up to the restaurant and ordered 4 meals, a lemon chicken, bbq pork, noodles and curry beef, the waitress came back and advised they had no chicken and the bbq pork was not available, we went with a sweet and sour pork and ribs only to be told again that neither were available. We ended up eating else where. The next morning we arrived for breakfast to see all three staff sat on their phones eating breakfast, there was no fresh stock, a young waiter stirred the pho and then tested it from the ladle and put the ladle back in the pot, this out us right off. On a plus note the bread was delicious and the check in to the hotel was fantastic\nRead more\nWritten August 26, 2019\nJames Nguyen\nDear OUR VALUE GUEST !\nwe could not find the infomation of this guest visit our restaurant! We have no idea who this reviewer is. We can find no record of him ever visit our hotel and he has not described it accurately. We believe that he has us confused with another property. This is not the way we do business. Please refer to the many good reviews about our property. \n\nKien Nguyen, Owner, Rosaliza hotel Hanoi\nRead more\nWritten November 1, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
