            "review_text": "SMtaste\nLondon, United Kingdom38 contributions\n3\nBreakfast was amazing!\nAug 2018 • Friends\nWe came here to have breakfast as this was the only place open at 6am on a Saturday. We were pleasantly surprised with the overwhelmingly friendly and helpful staff, and great choice of food. I was very happy that they served cereal as we hadn’t seen many places serving cereal during our month of travelling Vietnam. Nothing was too much for the staff and they went above and beyond to help us after arriving off the sleeper bus. They gave us a map of the city and recommendations of where to visit. Would highly recommend eating here!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 25, 2018",
