            "review_text": "fredluckyhy\nBuffalo, New York3 contributions\n5\nGood restaurant in Hanoi\nAug 2018\nVery good restaurant with many Vietnamese cuisine ! The cripy spring roll smake very good and staff were supper helpful\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 19, 2018\nJames Nguyen\nDear fredluckyhy!\n\nThank you for your time to write a great review about Rosaliza Restaurant on the Tripadvisor.com we are very happy to know that you enjoyed our menu , you like the cripy spring roll and helpful staff. \n\nThank you again and we are looking forward to see you in Hanoi at Rosaliza in your next trip to Hanoi \n\nThank you and best regrds.\n\nNguyen Kien\nGeneral Manager \nRosaliza Restaurant\nRead more\nWritten August 20, 2018\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
